</text><text x=\"98.3 120.8 129.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve Allaha sarılınız <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"109\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 109.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 44.2 44.2 51.7 51.7 60.0 75.7 84.0 84.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"60.0 75.7 93.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ki mevlânız odur. - İşinizi görecek veliyyül' emriniz, felâhı verecek efendiniz, muıniniz ancak Allahdır.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"220\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 219.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.7 30.7 45.0 45.0 51.7 59.3 75.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 90.7 97.6 114.7 126.0 126.0 133.6 133.6 141.7 150.7 150.7 158.3 174.0 183.0 183.0 189.7 189.7 196.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.0 75.0 97.6 141.7 174.0 196.6 203.3\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o, ne güzel mevlâ ve ne güzel nasîrdir. </p>","y":0}